        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Siena Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBring subtle elegance to any room of your home with the egg-shaped Siena knob. This knobset can be used on both interior and exterior doors and will fit standard door cutouts. It has an adjustable backset. Available in an array finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install a Schlage knob, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage knobs are study and do not tarnish, discolor, or corrode easily. Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Siena Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One Piece Knob for Better Security and Appearance</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast Zinc Tubular Lock Housing</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty on Residential Applications</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Knobs and Trim Rose</li>\r\n<li>Available in 8 Finishes</li>\r\n<li>Sold as Complete Set</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of the Schlage F-Series Siena Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button. Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only): </b>Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside knob is always unlocked. The outside knob is fixed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Lifetime Bright Brass (505) Finish is not available for single dummy or privacy sets.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
